OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer who put suspect in
OL,4,Aheadlock and punched him 9 times faces
OL,5,Amisconduct hearing
OL,6,
OL,7,FA police officer who punched a suspect
OL,8,Fnine times in the head used
OL,9,Funreasonable force on multiple
OL,10,Foccasions, a police misconduct hearing
OL,11,Fhas been told.
OL,13,FPC Richard Williams faces eight
OL,14,Fallegations relating to the arrest of
OL,15,FSteven Clark, including using a
OL,16,Fheadlock or "choker", unreasonable use
OL,17,Fof incapacitant spray, and throwing or
OL,18,Fdropping Clark into the back of a
OL,19,Fpolice van.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
