OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer who put suspect in
OL,4,Aheadlock and punched him 9 times faces
OL,5,Amisconduct hearing
OL,6,
OL,7,FA misconduct hearing at North Wales
OL,8,FPolice headquarters in Colwyn Bay heard
OL,9,FWilliams denies wrongdoing.
OL,11,FHe was cleared of assault and
OL,12,Fintentional strangulation following a
OL,13,Fseven-day trial in Caernarfon, Gwynedd,
OL,14,Fin 2025.
